6. Orchestration Tools
Tool: Kubernetes

Use: Automates deployment, scaling, and management of containerized applications.
Why Kubernetes?
Earlier tools like Docker Swarm and Mesos were limited in scalability and flexibility for large-scale environments.
Kubernetes offered:
Self-healing capabilities.
Advanced networking and service discovery.
Seamless horizontal scaling.
Drawbacks of Docker Swarm/Mesos:
Limited support for complex deployments.
Poor fault tolerance in large-scale systems.
